  "notes": [
    "ID0 bypass identity, key, range, Init, discrete mapping and empty unit are unchanged. Its audio fade is 5 ms; smoothing metadata remains 0.",
    "Simple controls are literal IDs110,111,123; UI order never generates IDs.",
    "Mode Gate0/Expand1/Duck2; Mode normalizes 0/.5/1; all other enums use fixed Off/On, Peak/RMS, Internal/External ordinals.",
    "Continuous smoothing is in physical units over 3 ms; Hold0ms smoothing means capture only on the next fall below Close. Enum transition milliseconds describe audio crossfades, not normalized ordinal interpolation.",
    "SC HP/LP enable flags preserve absolute-Hz targets while Off. Stored Off-state cutoff Init80Hz/12kHz are implementation choices where V1 specified only Off. Effective cutoff clamps at0.45Fs without changing saved normalization.",
    "RMS is fixed5ms exponential energy integration and Stereo Link fixed100%; neither has a fictitious adjustable parameter.",
    "Lookahead150 is a reserved, saved, host-automatable absolute0..10ms target with Init0. This build always uses Maximum0/effective0/PDC0; UI control disabled with reason. Nonzero target never claims implemented lookahead.",
    "No Maximum Lookahead configuration key, SC Listen host parameter, fake telemetry parameter, legacy migration or public command namespace has been invented.",
    "Bypass, all hidden/inactive targets and common schema1 seed/config entries save with the full state. UI preferences remain the common separate editor schema."
  ]
}
